# User Profile Context -- career-ops

## Your Target Roles

| Archetype | Thematic axes | What they buy |
|-----------|---------------|---------------|
| **Applied AI Engineer** | Agent workflows, automation systems, practical AI delivery | Someone who can turn AI concepts into operational systems quickly |
| **Forward Deployed Engineer** | Client-facing implementation, prototyping, deployment | Someone who can bridge business context and technical delivery |
| **Solutions Architect** | End-to-end architecture, integrations, reliability | Someone who can design and explain complete systems |
| **Solutions Engineer** | Discovery, demos, technical positioning, implementation support | Someone who can translate product capability into customer outcomes |

